03:03:57,220 --> 03:04:14,860
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang iba hindi po nagpareactivate para sa barangay and SK elections. So, yung po ang isang problema natin na dadagdagan pero nababawasan din sapagkat mga hindi po nakakaboto ng dalawang magkasunod na election na yung po ang nakalagay naman sa ating Republic Act 8189.

4143
03:04:14,860 --> 03:04:26,500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung continuing registration. But huwag po kayo mag-alala. Sisuguro din po namin lalo ang kabataan. Sila po ay magpaparehistro at boboto. Yung po ang importante. Critical.

4144
03:04:27,220 --> 03:04:30,060
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Magparehistrado. Unang hakbang sa pagboto.

4145
03:04:30,180 --> 03:04:45,440
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Maraming salamat. Last question na lang po. Sa Philippine Development Plan 2023 to 2028, isa sa mahalagang papel ng COMELEC ay ang pagpapalawig ng inclusivity at accessibility ng mga elections sa bansa.

4146
03:04:45,440 --> 03:05:00,000
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: Paano titiyakin ng COMELEC na ang pagpapalawak ng satellite at special registrations ay magiging inclusive lalo na para sa mga botante yung nasa geographically isolated?

4147
03:05:01,080 --> 03:05:19,620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Alam niyo po, yung kauna-unahan naming registration na ginawa para sa 2025, pumunta po kami sa Kalayaan Islands. Maaaring naiparehistro namin ay anim na po lang. Pero yun po ay napaka-symbolic kasi gusto naming ipakita sa lahat na kahit saan, mararating namin, magparehistro lang ng mga botante.

4148
03:05:19,620 --> 03:05:35,560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Number one, number two, na yung island na yan ay yung piece of property na yan ay sa Pilipinas. Sapagkat ang pinaparehistro namin, mga Pilipino. Pinuntahan po namin ang Camp Darapanan, ang Camp Abu Bakar, pinakamalalaking kampo ng MILF. First time na nagpa-register po diyan. Ibig sabihin, sobra pong init ng pagtanggap.

4149
03:05:35,560 --> 03:05:57,660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Dalawang araw po hindi pa natatapos ang registration. Pinuntahan po namin ang bulubundukin ng Bukidnon at saka yung pong tinatawag na Camp Dragon diyan po sa Sulu. Hindi na po bale may threat, may security, whatever. Importante makita ng mga kababayan natin na sila'y nagparehistro.

4150
03:05:57,660 --> 03:06:21,660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yun po ay talagang mga kabataan po ang nagparehistro naman. So, yung mga kampanyang yan, tama naman po kayo na dapat mas mapaigting pa natin. At dapat po, Mr. Chair, Your Honor, yung mga nakatatanda, mga may kapansanan, ang mga nagdadalang-tao at lalong-lalo na po katutubo.

4151
03:06:21,660 --> 03:06:42,980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung ating persons deprived of liberty, 68,000 po sila more or less, yung mga nakakulong. Sinisigurado po namin na nakakaboto sila kahit sa Bureau of Corrections at saka po sa BJMP ay makakaboto po sila. So para po yang lahat ng yan ay mapatunayan natin na inclusiveness ay pinakaimportante sa lahat. Wala po tayong dapat iiwan.

4152
03:06:42,980 --> 03:07:51,040
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Meron po tayong mga lugar dati, kahit yung kapihan na naging sikat dati sa Surigao, pinuntahan po namin yun. Yung mga lugar po ng mga indigenous peoples natin na apat na oras, limang oras nilalakad, pinupuntahan na rin po namin lahat yan para maiparehistro lang sila. First time, 80 years old, 85 years old, nagpaparehistro po sila. Mula sa Mindoro, sa Bukidnon, sa Tarlac, sa Zambales, kahit po sa Pampanga and such other places and Palawan. So, pero po madami pa rin po tayong mga kababayan na kinakailangang ma-reach ng komisyon. Kung kaya nga po yung pagtanggal sa amin ng budget na katulad na nabanggit ni Congresswoman Elago kanina, malaking bagay po yun sapagkat baka hindi na po namin sila basta marating dahil dito sa pagkaltas ng budget ng Commission on Elections. But ipinapangako po namin sa inyo, we will never leave anybody unregistered because disenfranchisement is never the business of this republic. Disenfranchisement is never the business of the Commission on Elections. Again, maraming salamat po.

4153
03:07:51,080 --> 03:07:57,180
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: And with that, Mr. Chairman, I would like to manifest and support the restoration

4154
03:07:57,200 --> 03:08:09,240
Rep. Amado Carlos A. Bolilia IV: of the proposed budget cut for COMELEC for the year 2027. Again, Mr. Chairman, thanks for your service to the Filipino people. Maraming salamat po. [palakpakan]

4155
03:08:09,240 --> 03:08:25,010
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Thank you, Cong. Kaloy. Thank you, Cong. Kaloy Bolilia. And next to interpolate, with permission from our vice chairs Cong. Zia and Cong. Rufus, would like to call on Representative Egay Erice.

4156
03:08:25,010 --> 03:08:28,720
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

4157
03:08:28,740 --> 03:08:58,720
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Again, good evening—good evening na po kanina. Good afternoon, Mr. Chair. Mr. Chair, I would be very candid with you because as you know, during the 2025 elections, we had a very heated altercation. Nag-file po ako ng case against you. Na-dismiss naman sa Ombudsman. Dinisqualify niyo ako; sana hindi na maulit.

4158
03:08:58,740 --> 03:09:28,720
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At ang sabi ng Supreme Court, "You committed a grave abuse of discretion in disqualifying me." Ang pinagmulan po niyan ay yung aking advocacy para sa political and electoral reforms. At sa tingin ko kasi ang pinakamalaking problema ng bansa natin kaya tayo bumabagsak ay political at electoral. At yan po yung aking mga advocacy in many, many proposals before the separation and electoral.

4159
03:09:28,740 --> 03:09:58,720
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ngayon po, nung nag-petition po ako against Miru nung nakaraan dahil sinabi ko prototype yan, bago yan, nakakatakot yan, at nung namang nag-work sinabi ko, okay, napatunayan ko. I've been a member of the Joint Congressional Committee on Automation for 12 years at marami naman po tayong experience diyan. Ngayon po gusto ko lang pong, ano, I just would like to get the real frame na mindset of the COMELEC and the COMELEC Advisory Council on the use of machines.

4160
03:09:58,740 --> 03:10:30,160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kasi po, as you said kanina, ang mindset niyo, brand new. Ang para sa akin, the COMELEC should rather specify, rather than brand new, yung performance standards: accuracy, reliability, security,

4161
03:10:30,180 --> 03:11:00,160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: auditability and hindi capacity to upgrade. Yun, mas tingin ko po, mas yun ang importante kaysa sa brand new. Second, sa experience ko sa automation, kung gagamitin natin yung nakaraan, palagay ko yung problema niyo na 9 billion na kulang baka konti na lang. At makakatipid yung mga Pilipino,

4162
03:11:00,180 --> 03:11:30,160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: makakatipid yung ating bansa sa isang sistema na napatunayan na. But I would like to give you the benefit of the doubt. So ganito po, hihingi lang po ako ng kopya nung bago ninyong terms of reference. Hingi po ako ng kopya kung may minutes of the meeting or resolution yung COMELEC Advisory Council para mapag-aralan ko po. And I assure that I will be very objective. Titignan ko kung necessary

4163
03:11:30,180 --> 03:11:46,840
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: yung bago o whimsical, at sasabihin ko po sa inyo sa plenary based on aking pag-aaral. Kaya po hinihiling ko na mabigyan niyo ako ng kopya before the plenary debates on the GAA. Salamat po.

4164
03:11:46,840 --> 03:12:00,160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yes po, Mr. Chair. We will definitely comply. Kasama na rin po yung terms of reference ng transmission at terms of reference ng OVCS po natin. Kasi po yung mga yan ay unbundled lahat and therefore, magkakaiba po ang terms of reference ng bawat isa.

4165
03:14:51,580 --> 03:14:59,400
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: First regular parliamentary elections. Historic siya dahil ang setup po sa BARM is parliamentary.

4166
03:15:00,000 --> 03:15:10,180
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: So ito po yung magtataglay doon sa katibayan na naging resulta nung usapang pangkapayapaan.

4167
03:15:10,820 --> 03:15:14,860
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: So we'd like to, for the chairman, to update this committee.

4168
03:15:15,300 --> 03:15:27,360
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: In view, Mr. Chair, of the recent ambush that happened against the sitting interim chief minister,

4169
03:15:27,360 --> 03:15:32,940
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: I would also like to find out from Comelec if the initial report of the police,

4170
03:15:33,320 --> 03:15:48,820
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: those who investigate the incident, has already determined the motive behind this attempt on the life of our sitting interim chief minister.

4171
03:15:48,820 --> 03:15:57,080
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Can we safely assume, for example, that this is a politically motivated,

4172
03:15:57,360 --> 03:16:03,420
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: act, or is it something else?

4173
03:16:04,480 --> 03:16:12,240
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Kasi we also would like to find out if this will be an isolated case,

4174
03:16:12,240 --> 03:16:22,100
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: meaning we would like to find out if this can be avoided up to the time when BARM holds its first regular election,

4175
03:16:22,580 --> 03:16:24,360
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: kasi gusto natin orderly and peaceful.

4176
03:16:24,900 --> 03:16:27,240
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: So yun lang po ang ating gustong magkaroon.

4177
03:16:27,360 --> 03:16:34,460
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Marinig na update sa ating napakagaling na chairman ng Commission on Elections.

4178
03:16:35,040 --> 03:16:36,400
Rep. Ziaur-Rahman "Zia" Alonto Adiong: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

4179
03:16:36,400 --> 03:16:38,560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Chair, Your Honors.

4180
03:16:39,280 --> 03:16:42,560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang eleksyon sa Bangsamoro sa September 14 ay tuloy na tuloy.

4181
03:16:42,720 --> 03:16:46,700
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Walang duda at wala na dapat pang ikabahala yung mga kababayan natin.

4182
03:16:47,120 --> 03:16:49,460
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Hindi na po tayo papayag ng resetting postponement.

4183
03:16:49,900 --> 03:16:54,620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At this point, walang restraining order from the Honorable Supreme Court and therefore, tuloy na tuloy po yan.

4184
03:16:54,900 --> 03:16:57,000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Walong pupo na seats ng Parliament.

4185
03:16:57,360 --> 03:16:58,440
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: May involved dyan.

4186
03:16:58,940 --> 03:17:01,720
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Dyan po ay may 32 na parliamentary districts.

4187
03:17:01,960 --> 03:17:03,980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Meron pong korenta mula sa political parties.

4188
03:17:04,380 --> 03:17:06,360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At may walo para sa sectoral organizations.

4189
03:17:06,360 --> 03:17:10,260
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 3.393 million ang botate sa buong Bangsamoro.

4190
03:17:10,380 --> 03:17:14,820
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 5,212 ang kanya pong presinto.

4191
03:17:15,280 --> 03:17:22,220
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At meron po siyang 1,816 na polling places o voting centers sa buong Bangsamoro.

4192
03:17:22,680 --> 03:17:24,760
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ngayon po, sa kasalukuyan,

4193
03:17:25,320 --> 03:17:27,240
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: nag-iisa lang po ang election-related incident.

4194
03:17:27,360 --> 03:17:29,360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: First time sa kasaysayan ng Bangsamoro.

4195
03:17:29,680 --> 03:17:32,440
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Of course, hindi naman po dahil sa bilang lamang.

4196
03:17:32,820 --> 03:17:34,600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Pero sa kasaysayan po ng Bangsamoro,

4197
03:17:34,720 --> 03:17:37,660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: whether nung ARM pa at ngayon nung ito ay BARM na,

4198
03:17:38,240 --> 03:17:40,660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ay isa lang ang election-related incident.

4199
03:17:41,260 --> 03:17:44,780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: In fact po, sa buong Bangsamoro, 27,

4200
03:17:45,380 --> 03:17:48,720
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ang sinasabi na under red category areas,

4201
03:17:48,800 --> 03:17:50,880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: 21 po dyan ay nasa Lanao del Sur.

4202
03:17:50,880 --> 03:17:54,480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: At tigitigisa ang Maguindanao del Norte, Maguindanao Sur,

4203
03:17:54,900 --> 03:17:57,220
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ang Basilan, Tawi-Tawi, at Zero.

4204
03:17:57,360 --> 03:17:58,880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang SGA naman.

4205
03:17:59,320 --> 03:18:02,780
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung pong 21 na red category areas,

4206
03:18:02,900 --> 03:18:04,160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: maaaring sa Lanao del Sur yan,

4207
03:18:04,260 --> 03:18:07,660
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: pero hindi po nangangahulugan na magulo o may recent na violence

4208
03:18:07,660 --> 03:18:08,640
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: doon sa 21.

4209
03:18:09,140 --> 03:18:11,240
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung hindi binasa lang po sa kasaysayan

4210
03:18:11,240 --> 03:18:13,640
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: nung mga lugar, dahil madami po kasing rido.

4211
03:18:14,220 --> 03:18:17,300
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Madami po mga pangyayari ng mga nakakarang mga halalan pa before

4212
03:18:17,300 --> 03:18:18,800
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na nagkaroon ng mga insidente,

4213
03:18:18,980 --> 03:18:20,340
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: pero hindi nangangahulugan na ngayon

4214
03:18:20,340 --> 03:18:22,200
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ay may insidente ng karahasan.

4215
03:18:22,720 --> 03:18:25,220
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Tama po kayo, yung isang election-related incident na yan

4216
03:18:25,220 --> 03:18:28,680
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ay patungkol sa ating interim chief minister.

4217
03:18:29,260 --> 03:18:32,160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Lima po ang pinaghihinalaan, napinpoint na po yan kung sino,

4218
03:18:32,600 --> 03:18:35,100
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: at mukhang ang chief minister mismo kilala niya kung sino yan.

4219
03:18:35,100 --> 03:18:37,880
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sapagkat during our last command conference,

4220
03:18:38,040 --> 03:18:39,760
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sinabi niya on record,

4221
03:18:40,300 --> 03:18:42,500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ibig sabihin po niya, pinapanumpaan niya,

4222
03:18:42,980 --> 03:18:48,160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: walang pagganti, walang retaliation,

4223
03:18:48,660 --> 03:18:50,060
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: at asahan nila ngayon,

4224
03:18:50,360 --> 03:18:51,500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: at kahit matapos ang election,

4225
03:18:52,020 --> 03:18:54,500
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: hindi gaganti siya o yung kanyang mga tauhan.

4226
03:18:54,500 --> 03:18:57,980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So yan po yung isang magandang statement

4227
03:18:57,980 --> 03:19:00,300
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: mula sa interim chief minister

4228
03:19:00,300 --> 03:19:02,460
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sapagkat at least po kahit paano

4229
03:19:02,460 --> 03:19:06,760
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ay naging mapayapa at naging nawala yung nabagabag yung mga kalooban

4230
03:19:06,760 --> 03:19:08,480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ng lahat po na naandun.

4231
03:19:08,920 --> 03:19:10,160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sa kasalukuyan din po,

4232
03:19:10,280 --> 03:19:12,020
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yung mga guro natin ay ongoing,

4233
03:19:12,320 --> 03:19:14,420
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: matatapos na ang training nila,

4234
03:19:14,820 --> 03:19:16,940
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yung ating mga technical people ay nagtitraining,

4235
03:19:17,060 --> 03:19:19,260
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: at lahat po ng kagamitan ay nakadeploy na

4236
03:19:19,260 --> 03:19:21,000
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sa lahat ng mga probinsya,

4237
03:19:21,420 --> 03:19:23,680
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sa mga tinatawag natin na provincial hubs

4238
03:19:23,680 --> 03:19:24,480
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ng komisyon.

4239
03:19:24,500 --> 03:19:25,380
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Asahan nyo po,

4240
03:19:25,760 --> 03:19:27,620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sa unang linggo pa lamang na September,

4241
03:19:28,180 --> 03:19:29,600
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: lahat pong ito, itong linggong ito,

4242
03:19:29,680 --> 03:19:31,200
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: lahat pong yan ay madideliver na

4243
03:19:31,200 --> 03:19:33,900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yung mga gamit sa lahat ng munisipyo.

4244
03:19:34,380 --> 03:19:36,540
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Ang mga balota po kasi ay sa treasurer's offices.

4245
03:19:37,060 --> 03:19:38,560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Yung pong mga election para pernalya,

4246
03:19:38,660 --> 03:19:40,360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: tulad ng makina, bateriya,

4247
03:19:40,780 --> 03:19:41,400
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ballot boxes,

4248
03:19:41,560 --> 03:19:44,900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: yan po ay dinideliver sa mga election officer

4249
03:19:44,900 --> 03:19:46,700
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ng local comelec.

4250
03:19:46,780 --> 03:19:47,620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: So asahan nyo po,

4251
03:19:48,080 --> 03:19:49,620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: meron po tayong September 12

4252
03:19:49,620 --> 03:19:51,980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na tinatawag na final testing and sealing.

4253
03:19:52,380 --> 03:19:53,180
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Lahat po,

4254
03:19:53,180 --> 03:19:55,840
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ng 5,212 na machines

4255
03:19:55,840 --> 03:19:58,420
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sa 5,212 na presinto

4256
03:19:58,420 --> 03:19:59,580
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: ay susubukan

4257
03:19:59,580 --> 03:20:01,360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: kung gumagana ng maayos,

4258
03:20:01,520 --> 03:20:02,920
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: magbibilang ba siya ng maayos

4259
03:20:02,920 --> 03:20:05,540
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: at makakapag-transmit ba ng maayos.

4260
03:20:05,860 --> 03:20:07,160
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Kung sakali po may mga guro

4261
03:20:07,160 --> 03:20:09,180
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na hindi po maghahapaglingkod

4262
03:20:09,740 --> 03:20:10,560
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sa araw ng election,

4263
03:20:11,220 --> 03:20:13,060
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: meron po tayong more or less 2,000

4264
03:20:13,060 --> 03:20:16,300
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na mga PNP personnel

4265
03:20:16,300 --> 03:20:17,900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na tinrain po natin

4266
03:20:17,900 --> 03:20:19,360
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na pwedeng humalinhin,

4267
03:20:19,780 --> 03:20:21,380
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: mag-substitute o pumalit sa kanila.

4268
03:20:21,480 --> 03:20:23,060
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Sila po ay hindi nang galing sa

4269
03:20:23,060 --> 03:20:23,640
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Bangsamoro.

4270
03:20:24,060 --> 03:20:25,340
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Galing po sila sa Region 10,

4271
03:20:25,960 --> 03:20:27,060
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sa Region 9,

4272
03:20:27,220 --> 03:20:27,980
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: sa Region 11,

4273
03:20:28,320 --> 03:20:29,200
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: at sa Region 12.

4274
03:20:29,520 --> 03:20:30,900
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: Upang masigurado po namin

4275
03:20:30,900 --> 03:20:32,620
COMELEC Chairperson George Erwin M. Garcia: na wala pong magka-question

4276
03:20:32,620 --> 03:20:34,560
